## Viewing Campaign History

### Accessing Automation History

1. Click the **Automation History icon** (🕐) in the top navigation
2. You'll see all your scheduled and sent campaigns

### Understanding Status

Each automation (email) has one of these statuses:

| Status | Badge Color | Meaning |
|--------|-------------|---------|
| **Scheduled** | Maroon | Email is queued and will be sent at the scheduled time |
| **Processing** | Maroon | Email is currently being sent |
| **Completed** | Green | Email was successfully sent |
| **Failed** | Red | Email failed to send (check error message) |

### Filtering by Status

Use the tabs at the top to filter automations:
- **All**: Show all automations
- **Scheduled**: Only future/pending emails
- **Completed**: Only successfully sent emails
- **Failed**: Only emails that encountered errors

### Viewing Details

1. Click **"View Details"** on any automation
2. You'll see complete information:
   - **Template Information**: Which template was used
   - **Execution Details**: Status, scheduled time, actual send time
   - **Email Content**: Exact subject and body that was sent
   - **Error Message**: If failed, what went wrong

### Understanding the Automation Table

| Column | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Template** | Name of the template used |
| **Status** | Current status (scheduled, completed, failed) |
| **Scheduled For** | When the email was supposed to send |
| **Recipient** | Email address of recipient |
| **Executed At** | When the email actually sent (if completed) |
| **Actions** | View detailed information |

### Pagination

If you have many automations, use:
- **Previous** / **Next** buttons to navigate pages
- **Page indicator** shows current page and total pages

